<Component>
	<Description>
		IF[switches]EQUAL_OR_HIGHER_THAN 2 THEN Package of simple switches.
		All these switches are controlled together in the same way:
		ELSE A simple switch.ENDIF
		It can be controlled over the simulated time by setting the eeschema value, by pairs t c where
		t is the time value and c is 0 or 1 (0 for non-connecting switch "OFF", 1 for connecting switch "ON").
		For example,
		0 0  1.4ms 0  1.6ms 1  2.4ms 1  2.8ms 0
		Which can be read as: start at time 0 with a non-connecting switch.
		stay unconnected until 1.4ms. 
		In the time span between 1.4ms to 1.6ms switch to connecting.
		Stay connected until 2.4ms.
		In the time span between 2.4ms and 2.8ms switch back to non-connecting.
		(Stay at non-connecting status)

		IF[r_on]THENIn connecting status, R=[r_on]Ohm.ENDIF IF[r_off]THENIn non-connecting status, R=[r_off]Ohm.ENDIF
	</Description>
	<eeschema_sch>
